Arsenic in Terai tube wells.

3
00:00:03,958 --> 00:00:15,039
The national standard is fifty parts per billion, just zero point zero five milligram per litre, and the World Health Organisation guideline is even lower, ten ppb.

4
00:00:15,039 --> 00:00:17,799
Tiny numbers, serious health limits.

